|===
| Category                               | `fix_orphan_a` | `fix_hu_typographical_rules`
| *Files scanned*                        | 109            | 109
| *Files affected*                       | 105            | 105
| *Total corrections*                    | *8,225*        | *14,489*
| - Orphan articles & conjunctions       | 8,225          | 14,111
| - `e-mail-cím` & compound terms        | -              | 57
| - Parenthetical dashes (` -- `, ` – `) | -              | 290
| - Numbers, ordinals, and units         | -              | 31
|===
